<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Latin poem in a manuscript of the Bibliothèque nationale de France</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1287</span><span class="sg-chain-h">two verses close to the later song's</span></li></ul></section>
